        "summary": "Octanuclear Dy8 butterfly cage is an SMM. χMT(300 K) = 105.95 cm3 K mol−1 (calc. 113.36 for 8 DyIII), decreasing to 90.83 cm3 K mol−1 at 10 K (0.5 T), consistent with weak antiferromagnetic interactions/Stark depopulation. Zero-field ac data show frequency-dependent χ′/χ″ below ~8 K without χ″ maxima (QTM). Under 0.5 T, maxima appear below ~6 K; Arrhenius fit gives Δeff = 49.3 K and τ0 = 9.0 × 10−10 s.",
